Bugfix: Translations name owncloud.online instead of the old product

Several translations of the core and the bundled apps still showed the old
product name, partly misspelt or transliterated, for example the German notice
that the instance is in single user mode and the hints about trusted and
federated servers. They now name owncloud.online, in the .json and in the .js
file of each language. Example paths in the sharing hint and placeholders are
unchanged.
